    {
      "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-0b7d447826e3f8c1a8de8d12",
      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "采用滞后校正可能会得出时间常数大到不能实现的结果，这是由于需要在足够小的频率值上安置滞后网络第一个交接频率1/T，以保证在需要的频率范围内产生有效的高频幅值衰减特性所致。",
      "aliases": [],
      "description": null,
      "governance": {
        "reviewStatus": "approved",
        "publicationStatus": "published",
        "lifecycleStatus": null
      },
      "semanticSupport": {
        "supported": true,
        "readOnly": true
      },
      "memberships": [
        {
          "domainId": "classical-control-design",
          "visualRole": "design",
          "preferred": true
        }
      ],
      "conceptKind": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-4db8271ddf72e4739741af2c",
      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "1） 根据稳态误差要求，确定开环增益K。2） 画出待校正系统的开环对数频率特性，确定截止频率ωc'、相角裕度γ和幅值裕度h。3） 选择不同的ωc''，绘制γ（ωc''）曲线。4） 根据相角裕度γ''要求，选择已校正系统的截止频率ωc''。5） 确定滞后网络参数b和T。6） 验算已校正系统的相角裕度和幅值裕度。",
      "aliases": [],
      "description": null,
      "governance": {
        "reviewStatus": "approved",
        "publicationStatus": "published",
        "lifecycleStatus": null
      },
      "semanticSupport": {
        "supported": true,
        "readOnly": true
      },
      "memberships": [
        {
          "domainId": "classical-control-design",
          "visualRole": "design",
          "preferred": true
        }
      ],
      "conceptKind": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-66926d13971b8a280d1cdd1c",
      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "对于同一系统，采用超前校正的系统带宽大于采用滞后校正的系统带宽。",
      "aliases": [],
      "description": null,
      "governance": {
        "reviewStatus": "approved",
        "publicationStatus": "published",
        "lifecycleStatus": null
      },
      "semanticSupport": {
        "supported": true,
        "readOnly": true
      },
      "memberships": [
        {
          "domainId": "classical-control-design",
          "visualRole": "design",
          "preferred": true
        }
      ],
      "conceptKind": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-7572b812f994f30ab6f5b279",
      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "为了满足严格的稳态性能要求，当采用无源校正网络时，超前校正要求一定的附加增益，而滞后校正一般不需要附加增益。",
      "aliases": [],
      "description": null,
      "governance": {
        "reviewStatus": "approved",
        "publicationStatus": "published",
        "lifecycleStatus": null
      },
      "semanticSupport": {
        "supported": true,
        "readOnly": true
      },
      "memberships": [
        {
          "domainId": "classical-control-design",
          "visualRole": "design",
          "preferred": true
        }
      ],
      "conceptKind": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-77a4873907d81885333ef93b",
      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "如果将已校正系统对数幅频特性向上平移，则校正前后的相角裕度和截止频率基本相同，但开环增益却增大。",
      "aliases": [],
      "description": null,
      "governance": {
        "reviewStatus": "approved",
        "publicationStatus": "published",
        "lifecycleStatus": null
      },
      "semanticSupport": {
        "supported": true,
        "readOnly": true
      },
      "memberships": [
        {
          "domainId": "classical-control-design",
